          "kicker": "Tournament success",
          "heading": "Fijiana win inaugural WXV Global Series Challenger title after Dutch victory",
          "body": "Fijiana secured the inaugural World Rugby WXV Global Series Challenger title following a hard-fought 20-17 win against the Netherlands in Hong Kong. Tries from Merewairita Neivosa and Ivamere Nabura Rokowati helped Fiji hold a 12-7 halftime lead. Despite the Dutch side surging ahead in the second half through Pleuni Kievit, Fiji stayed in the hunt before clinching the victory with a match-winning penalty kick in the 80th minute, ultimately finishing at the top of the event’s final table."
        },
