          "heading": "Siya Kolisi continues Stormers tenure as official transfer news stays silent",
          "body": "Speculation surrounding Siya Kolisi’s immediate club future persists as the South African flanker remains involved with the Stormers. Following reports earlier this month of potential interest from overseas, recent coverage confirms his participation in team activities and warm-ups during the side's recent trip to Galway. Despite ongoing headlines regarding a possible departure, no formal announcement regarding a transfer has been made by the player or his current club, leaving the status of his career in the United Rugby Championship unchanged."
