          "kicker": "Historical Stat",
          "heading": "France Record Shortest Time Spent At World Number One Ranking",
          "body": "While France has consistently featured as a top-tier contender in recent international campaigns, the team's historical record for holding the top spot in the World Rugby rankings remains brief. France has experienced many high-scoring performances in their last five matches, but their longest unbroken spell at No. 1 in the world lasted exactly 1 week, recorded between July 2022 and July 2022."
