          "kicker": "Tribute",
          "heading": "Scottish Rugby mourns the passing of respected coach Ally Donaldson",
          "body": "Scottish Rugby and Edinburgh have paid tribute to Ally Donaldson, who has died aged 60. A former Edinburgh captain and stand-off, Donaldson was a transformative figure in the capital, later serving as director of rugby at George Watson’s College and coaching at Currie. Scottish Rugby president Keith Wallace described the news as a \"huge shock,\" noting Donaldson’s lasting legacy in developing players who went on to represent Scotland. Donaldson was also a former Scotland Club XV and age-grade coach."
