          "kicker": "Bledisloe Cup build-up",
          "heading": "Australia target momentum boost as Bledisloe Cup series looms next month",
          "body": "Following their victory over the Springboks in Perth, the Wallabies have climbed to sixth in the global rankings, providing a platform to build upon against the All Blacks. Head coach Les Kiss has emphasised the squad's strong internal connection, though pundits have suggested further tactical discipline is required to maintain their current trajectory. As the side prepares for the upcoming Bledisloe Cup, critics note that the upcoming two-Test series remains the true barometer for Australia's progress ahead of the 2027 World Cup."
        },
